     "VIX/रेजीम आधारित सीमित-जोखिम रणनीति रिसर्च—लाइव लेग मूल्य, पेऑफ, ब्रेकईवन और अनुमानित पोर्टफोलियो ग्रीक्स।",
     "Analyze manually, save a REVIEW CANDIDATE and monitor every 5 minutes. TPS can return Bull Call Debit Spread, Bear Put Debit Spread or Iron Condor, then HOLD, WATCH or EXIT/REASSESS with defined-risk close/replacement legs. Always verify margin and quotes in broker.",
     "Manual Analyze karein, REVIEW CANDIDATE save karein aur 5-minute monitor use karein. TPS Spread/Condor ke baad HOLD, WATCH ya EXIT/REASSESS aur defined-risk close/replacement legs bata sakta hai; broker margin/quote verify karein.",
